<title>HONG KONG: HK per capita GDP now US$24,500 - Tsang.</title>
<headline>HK per capita GDP now US$24,500 - Tsang.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's per capita gross domestic product (GDP) now stands at US$24,500, Financial Secretary Donald Tsang said in his 1997/98 budget speech on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6352</p>
</text>
